==Faroese==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|biðja|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*bidjaną}}. Cognate with {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|bitten|lang=de}}, {{etyl|is|-}} {{term|biðja|lang=fo}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{term|bede|lang=da}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{term|bedja|lang=sv}}, English [[bede]], [[bead]].

===Verb===
{{fo-verb|bað|bóðu|biðið}}
# to [[ask]], to [[request]], to [[beg]]
# to [[wish]] (e.g. ''[[góðan dag]]'' - good day)
# to [[pray]] to God (''[[Gud]]'')

====Conjugation====
{{fo-conj-66|b|i|ð|a|ó}}

